<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n15834" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ensis</span></b> , is, m.
		Sanscr. root as-, asyati, hurl; asi, sword, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a sword</i>, <i>brand.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b> Prop. (almost exclusively
			in the poets; synon. with gladius, acc. to <i><span class="en">Quint. 10,
				1, 11</span></i>; cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">also spatha, acinaces, sica, mucro, pugio),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Lucr.
					5, 1293</span></i>
			; Cic. poët. ap. <i><span class="en">Gell. 15,
				6, 3</span></i>; and <i><span class="en">id. N. D. 2, 63 <i>fin.</i></span></i>; <i><span class="en">Tib. 1, 3, 47</span></i>; <i><span class="en">1, 10, 1</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ensem haesurum jugulo puto,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov.
					Tr. 1, 1, 484</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Verg. A. 2, 393</span></i>; <i><span class="en">553</span></i> et
			saep.; <i><span class="en">Liv. 7, 10, 9</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Meton.</b>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<i>War</i>, <i><span class="en">Sil. 7, 167</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Stat. S. 4,
				7, 45</span></i>; cf.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lateque vagatur ensis, i. e. slaughter,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Luc.
					2, 102</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b> For
			defensor: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">MARCELLO ROMANORVM ENSI,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Inscr. Momms. 1984</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>C.</b>
			<i>Royal sway</i>, <i><span class="en">Luc. 5,
			61</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>D.</b>
			Ensis, <i>the constellation</i> Orion, <i><span class="en">Val. Fl. 2,
				68</span></i>; cf. ensifer. 
			</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
